    ["<Assistant_Title1>гЂђVoice Room - Play Voice RoomгЂ‘</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Required Level: </>Cognition Level <Assistant_Red>Level 10</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Chat Panel - Voice Room</>{JumpToUI:[гЂђGo to ViewгЂ‘]|1250316}\n<Assistant_Title2>Capacity Limit: </>Voice rooms can hold up to 1000 people.\n<Assistant_Title2>Default Speech Mode: </>Play voice rooms default to Host-Set Speech Order mode; you must click the unmute button to request to speak, and the host must approve it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Heartbeat Signal: </>Players on the mic sequence automatically gain guest status; the player on Mic 1 is the Guest of Honor. All guests in the voice room can express emotions by switching their 'Light Up' status. You can view the current speaking and 'Light Up' status of all guests more intuitively via the live interface in the top right corner of the room.\n<Assistant_Title2>Host Operations: </>The host can adjust the speech order in member permission settings, set mutes and room blacklists, and adjust room information, extend the duration of a permanent room, or transfer host status in the right sidebar settings.\n<Assistant_Title2>Other Operations: </>You can share the voice room link or distribute voice room gifts via the right sidebar.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Host Permissions]|1395}, {SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Standard Voice Room]|1396}, {SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Permanent Room]|1398}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>гЂђР“РѕР»РѕСЃРѕРІР°СЏ РєРѕРјРЅР°С‚Р° вЂ“ Р’РѕСЃРїСЂРѕРёР·РІРµРґРµРЅРёРµ РіРѕР»РѕСЃРѕРІРѕР№ РєРѕРјРЅР°С‚С‹гЂ‘</>\n<Assistant_Title2>РўСЂРµР±СѓРµРјС‹Р№ СѓСЂРѕРІРµРЅСЊ: </>РЈСЂРѕРІРµРЅСЊ РїРѕР·РЅР°РЅРёСЏ <Assistant_Red>РЈСЂРѕРІРµРЅСЊ 10</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Р”РѕСЃС‚СѓРї Рє СЃРёСЃС‚РµРјРµ: </><Assistant_System>РџР°РЅРµР»СЊ С‡Р°С‚Р° вЂ“ Р“РѕР»РѕСЃРѕРІР°СЏ РєРѕРјРЅР°С‚Р°</>{JumpToUI:[[РџРµСЂРµР№С‚Рё Рє РїСЂРѕСЃРјРѕС‚СЂ]]|1250316}\n<Assistant_Title2>РћРіСЂР°РЅРёС‡РµРЅРёРµ РµРјРєРѕСЃС‚Рё: </>Р“Р